      <h3 id="update-availability-data_how-updates-work" class="group scroll-mt-20">Update availability data<a href="#update-availability-data_how-updates-work" class="ml-2 text-muted-foreground opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 no-underline" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1">&para;</a></h3>
